(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Living and non-living things.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising using evidence to decide if something is living.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Seven life processes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "All living things carry out seven life processes: they move, breathe, feed, grow, reproduce, excrete waste, and sense and respond.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Non-living things.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Non-living things do not carry out all seven life processes. A car moves and uses fuel, but it cannot grow or reproduce, so it is not living.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What plants need to grow.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Plants need water, light and air to grow well. Most also need soil for nutrients and to hold their roots.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Is a candle flame living or non-living?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Check the life processes. A flame seems to move and grow, and it needs air.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "But it cannot reproduce by itself, and it does not sense and respond like a living thing.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "So a candle flame is non-living, even though it shares some features with living things.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these into living and non-living.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Ask: does it grow and reproduce?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A mushroom is a fungus. It grows and makes spores.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A cloud moves and changes, but it does not feed or reproduce.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Dogs, trees and mushrooms are living. Rocks, clouds and bicycles are non-living.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A plant on a windowsill bends towards the light. Which life process is this?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sensing and responding": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Excreting": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Reproducing": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Breathing": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The plant notices something around it.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Then it reacts.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Noticing and reacting is called ...": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The plant senses the light and responds by bending towards it.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why is a car NOT a living thing, even though it moves?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It cannot grow or reproduce": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It is made of metal": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It is too big": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It makes a noise": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Living things carry out all seven life processes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Can a car make baby cars?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Can a car get bigger by itself?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A car moves and uses fuel, but it cannot grow or reproduce.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A bean seed is kept in a dry box. Is it living?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes, it can grow when it gets water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "No, it doesn't move": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "No, it is too small": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Only on weekends": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about what happens when you plant a seed and water it.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A seed is waiting for the right conditions.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It can grow and make a new plant.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A seed is living. It is resting until it gets water and warmth, then it grows.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Musa puts one plant in a dark cupboard and one in the sun. Both get the same water. What do you predict?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The plant in the sun grows better": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Both grow the same": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The plant in the cupboard grows better": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Neither plant changes": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What do plants need to grow?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The only difference is light.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which plant has everything it needs?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Plants need light to grow well, so the plant in the sun will grow better. The plant in the dark will turn pale and weak.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "In Musa's test, why do both plants get the same amount of water?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "So that light is the only thing that is different": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Because water is cheap": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "So they look the same": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It doesn't matter": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A fair test changes only one thing.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is Musa trying to find out about?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "If water were different too, could we tell what made the difference?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "In a fair test, only one thing changes. Here it is light, so we know light caused any difference.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How did you decide if something was living?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Checked the seven processes": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thought of examples I know": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagined what it does over time": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Scientists use evidence, not just how things look, to decide.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Life processes. the things every living thing does.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Respond. react to something.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Excrete. get rid of waste.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
